      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "We saw how quickly I can build a proof of concept. \n\nBut moving to production is just as simple. To do that, get my agent — or a fleet of them —  production-ready, I’ll move into Microsoft Foundry. ",
      "demo_actions": "Transition from the local proof of concept to the enterprise build environment. Frame this as the move from local validation into a production-ready deployment path.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260622_142419_vlcsnap-2026-06-22-14h24m13s620.png"
    },
    {
