      "time": "~40s",
      "narrative": "Can still use my same canvas to chat with this. \n\nYou'll see traces and evals here — hold that thought. \n\nWe come back to them in the evaluation chapter. Right now, this is still about building. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Open the Foundry Toolkit panels in VS Code. Show hosted models, playground access, session history, traces, and evaluations, then run a quick interaction and inspect the result.",
