      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Even more critical is I want to get this agent into the hands of my team, right where they work every day. \n\nBecause the entire Microsoft stack is connected and integrated, distribution is simple.\n\nI can easily put it where people already work — starting with Microsoft Teams, anywhere in M365 and even in 3P services. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Show the deployment target and the connection into Microsoft Teams. Frame this as the move from builder tooling into an everyday work surface.",
