      "narrative": "So a local prototype is now an enterprise agent: grounded in Caldova's data, hosted in Foundry, and available in the tools the team already lives in. \n\nBuild is done. Now the real question — is it doing what we expect it to do? Is it giving us the results the business needs? And is it operating with the balance of cost and performance that protects our ROI? ",
